  "details": "The index users (as well as xbox controllers and desktop users) get a dedicated mic toggle button. Index users may not even have noticed, but simply going into the built in steamvr settings and selecting custom bindings, it's listed as an option. A feature that is possible with other controllers like the rift, but they never implemented it. The A and X buttons do literally nothing and can be used for such. It can be annoying to have open mic and have to toggle it through the menu sometimes.",
